      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "When the Southern Pacific Railroad arrived in 1891, the town was renamed Pollasky after official Marcus Pollasky.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
