      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Friant%2C_California",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town enjoys a hot‑summer Mediterranean climate, with July highs routinely hitting 108°F.",
